OL,3,GNEWSA'It's tradition' - Hundreds gather
OL,4,Afor huge annual bonfire on housing
OL,5,Aestate
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of residents have attended a
OL,8,F"massive" community-run bonfire at a
OL,9,Fhousing estate, with a local resident
OL,10,Fsaying it helped bring "people
OL,11,Ftogether".
OL,13,FThe "unofficial" event took place at
OL,14,FPenrhys housing estate, Rhondda Cynon
OL,15,FTaf, on Thursday, featuring a bonfire
OL,16,Festimated to be 80ft (24m) wide and
OL,17,F20ft (6m) tall.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
