OL,3,GNEWSA'It's tradition' - Hundreds gather
OL,4,Afor huge annual bonfire on housing
OL,5,Aestate
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents said the annual event has
OL,8,Fbeen running for almost 30 years and is
OL,9,Fnow known as a "tradition" for local
OL,10,Fpeople, despite previous warnings about
OL,11,Fsafety.
OL,13,FRhondda Cynon Taf council declined to
OL,14,Fcomment on this year's event but South
OL,15,FWales Fire and Rescue Service, which
OL,16,Furged people to attend licensed
OL,17,Ffirework displays, confirmed no
OL,18,Fincidents were reported at the event.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
